---
// Notă de confidențialitate (GDPR, art. 13). Site static: fără cookies, fără tracking, fără formulare.
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { profile } from "../data/cv";
const updated = "9 November 2026";
---

<BaseLayout title={`Privacy notice — ${profile.name}`} description="How this portfolio site handles personal data.">
  <article class="container privacy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy notice</p>
    <h1>Your privacy on this site</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <p class="tldr">
      <strong>In short:</strong> this is a static portfolio. It sets <strong>no cookies</strong>, uses <strong>no analytics or tracking</strong>,
      loads <strong>no third-party scripts or fonts</strong> and has <strong>no forms</strong>. I don't collect any personal data about you.
    </p>

    <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
    <p>
      {profile.name}, {profile.location}. Contact:
      <a href="/#contact" data-mail data-mail-text data-u={profile.emailUser} data-d={profile.emailDomain}>email me</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
    <p>
      This site does not set cookies and does not store anything in your browser (no localStorage, no session storage).
      That's why there is no cookie banner — there is nothing to consent to.
    </p>

    <h2>Hosting (GitHub Pages)</h2>
    <p>
      The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, operated by GitHub, Inc. When you open a page, your browser connects to GitHub's servers,
      which may process technical data such as your IP address, browser type and the time of the request, in order to deliver the
      site and keep it secure. I have no access to this data. The legal basis is legitimate interest in providing a secure website
      (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). For details, including international data transfers, see the
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub General Privacy Statement</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>If you email me</h2>
    <p>
      If you contact me by email, I use your email address and message only to reply to you (Art. 6(1)(b) and (f) GDPR).
      I keep the conversation only as long as needed for that purpose and don't share it with anyone.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Under the GDPR you have the right to access, correct or delete your personal data, to restrict or object to its processing
      and to data portability. To exercise them, just email me. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory
      authority — in Romania, the
      <a href="https://www.dataprotection.ro" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">National Supervisory Authority for Personal Data Processing (ANSPDCP)</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="back"><a href="/">← Back to the portfolio</a></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy { max-width: 760px; padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 4rem; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { margin: 0.3rem 0 0.25rem; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.4rem); }
  .updated { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .tldr { padding: 1rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 14px; background: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; }
  h2 { margin: 2rem 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  p { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
  .back { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
</style>
